  "decision": "Retain current position within the unchanged design. The 0.5mm lower candidate improves projected annular coverage only from about56.1% to58.2% while reducing P22 clearance from1.2 to0.7mm. Larger lowering/centering collides with rigid existing parts. Inward-only movement requires printed-mount changes and does not improve projected alignment. No demonstrated thermal benefit justifies sacrificing the approved clearance cushion."
